{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>在美國加州聖克拉拉的英偉達總部外，有人於公司標誌前擺放多束鮮花，並放置了一支裝在玻璃罐中的白色蠟燭，被外界視為致敬黃仁勳這位AI時代標誌性人物。現場畫面顯示，一名路人將玻璃罐裝蠟燭放在「NVIDIA」標誌前；鮮花則整齊靠在標誌下方。這些物品沒有附帶留言，但被外界視為告別與致敬剛剛辭去行政總裁職務的聯合創始人黃仁勳。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/finance/transform/145/w550h395/20261113/f09e-0a8cd0037e10ddf719865fcf7b2d910b.png\">\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/finance/transform/117/w550h367/20261113/05b7-e025b772aebbc77bdf1ecc2d02a11752.jpg\">\n</p>\n\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/finance/transform/145/w550h395/20261113/f09e-0a8cd0037e10ddf719865fcf7b2d910b.png\">\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/finance/transform/117/w550h367/20261113/05b7-e025b772aebbc77bdf1ecc2d02a11752.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T05:56:42.162772+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":4,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T05:36:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T06:30:34.948556+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T05:50:12.791478+00:00","content_hash":"cac60c1c8fa41ae7cdde80bd918461fb95c496e104df0813800d5b2ccbde8a55","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}